5. Authorization Application Types
AMS will support exactly the SOP categories:
Initial
First authorization request.
________________________________________
Renewal
Continuation of existing authorization.
Conditions checked:
•	Audit involvement
•	Current training
•	Competency requirements
________________________________________
Extension
Adding additional scope.
Example:
Existing:
Auditor - Airworthiness
Request:
Lead Auditor - IMS
________________________________________
Amendment
Change of existing authorization information.
Examples:
•	Name
•	Employee ID
•	Personal details
•	Scope reduction
•	Authorization number change
________________________________________
Lost
Replacement of lost authorization.
