8. Assessment Module
The paper checklist:
TMA/QA/GEN/12c
will become a digital assessment.
Sections:
1.	Qualification
2.	Experience
3.	Training
4.	Extension Criteria
5.	Renewal Criteria
6.	Knowledge
7.	Understanding
8.	Ability
9.	Practical Assessment
10.	Remarks
11.	Final Result
Assessment result:
•	Pass
•	Fail
•	Additional Training Required
•	Follow-up Assessment Required
