9. Certificate Generation
After HQC approval:
AMS automatically creates:
•	CA Number
•	Certificate PDF
•	Validity dates
•	Approved scope
•	Limitations
•	Terms and Conditions
Certificate follows the approved template provided.
________________________________________
10. Candidate Acknowledgement
Mandatory feature.
Candidate must confirm:
"I have read and understood the privileges, limitations and conditions of this authorization."
AMS records:
•	Candidate name
•	Employee number
•	Date/time
•	Authorization number
•	Version of terms acknowledged
